      "en": "his body must not remain all night on the tree; instead you must make certain you bury[NOTE:1] him that same day, for the one who is left exposed[NOTE:2] on a tree is cursed by God.[NOTE:3] You must not defile your land that the Lord your God is giving you as an inheritance.",
